    {
      "unit_id": "u0001",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "source_text": "# Chron-LLM R0 Runtime\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 3,
      "source_text": "# Start Entry Specification v1.0\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5,
      "source_text": "**Status:** Frozen Reference Specification\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 7,
      "source_text": "**Layer:** R0 Entry Layer\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 9,
      "source_text": "**Package:** `chronos-r0`\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "source_text": "# 1. 概要\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 26,
      "source_text": "このファイルは **Chron-LLM R0** の最上位エントリポイントを定義する。\n\n責務は極めて限定されており、\n\n* Runtime生成\n* Chat Loop実行\n\nを実装せず、\n\n**チャットシステムへの起動委譲のみ**\n\nを行う。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "source_text": "# 2. アーキテクチャ上の位置\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 51,
      "source_text": "```\nUser\n\n  │\n\n  ▼\n\nstart-chat\n  │\n\n  ▼\n\nchronos-r0.chat:start-chat\n\n  │\n\n  ▼\n\nChat Runtime\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 53,
      "line_end": 57,
      "source_text": "本ファイルは\n\n**Facade**\n\nとしてのみ存在する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 61,
      "line_end": 61,
      "source_text": "# 3. Package\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 63,
      "line_end": 65,
      "source_text": "```\nchronos-r0\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 67,
      "line_end": 67,
      "source_text": "このパッケージに属する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 71,
      "line_end": 71,
      "source_text": "# 4. 公開API\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 73,
      "line_end": 75,
      "source_text": "```\nstart-chat\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 77,
      "line_end": 77,
      "source_text": "のみを提供する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 81,
      "line_end": 81,
      "source_text": "# 5. 関数仕様\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 83,
      "line_end": 83,
      "source_text": "## start-chat\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 85,
      "line_end": 87,
      "source_text": "```\n(start-chat)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0020",
      "line_start": 89,
      "line_end": 89,
      "source_text": "### 役割\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0021",
      "line_start": 91,
      "line_end": 91,
      "source_text": "R0チャットシステムを起動する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0022",
      "line_start": 95,
      "line_end": 95,
      "source_text": "### 実装\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0023",
      "line_start": 97,
      "line_end": 100,
      "source_text": "```\n(defun start-chat ()\n    (chronos-r0.chat:start-chat))\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0024",
      "line_start": 104,
      "line_end": 104,
      "source_text": "### 動作\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0025",
      "line_start": 106,
      "line_end": 119,
      "source_text": "関数自身は\n\n* Runtime生成しない\n* Prompt生成しない\n* Session生成しない\n* History生成しない\n\n単純に\n\n```\nchronos-r0.chat:start-chat\n```\n\nへ処理を委譲する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0026",
      "line_start": 123,
      "line_end": 123,
      "source_text": "# 6. 責務\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0027",
      "line_start": 125,
      "line_end": 143,
      "source_text": "この層の責務は\n\n```\nEntry Point\n```\n\nのみである。\n\nつまり\n\n```\n起動要求\n\n↓\n\nChat Runtimeへ転送\n```\n\nのみ行う。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0028",
      "line_start": 147,
      "line_end": 147,
      "source_text": "# 7. 非責務\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0029",
      "line_start": 149,
      "line_end": 149,
      "source_text": "このモジュールは以下を一切実装しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0030",
      "line_start": 151,
      "line_end": 153,
      "source_text": "## Prompt構築\n\n×\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0031",
      "line_start": 157,
      "line_end": 159,
      "source_text": "## History管理\n\n×\n"
    },
    {
